Although only one thread executes at any instant, all clients make progress.

This is concurrency.

Benefits of Threads
Multiple clients can be served simultaneously.
One slow or idle client does not block others.
Better CPU utilization.
Improved responsiveness.
Enables concurrent execution within the same process.
